{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-10-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION GROWTH IN LATAM UNDERPINS EQUINIX US$45M INVESTMENT IN ITS SECOND DATA CENTER IN COLOMBIA', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , OCT. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE\xa0COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED A US$45 MILLION INVESTMENT IN COLOMBIA FOR THE CONSTRUCTION OF BG2, A NEW INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS EXCHANGE™ (IBX®) DATA CENTER IN BOGOTÁ, SCHEDULED TO OPEN IN THE FIRST HALF OF 2023."}